# Paper Pelle 

**A browser game for learning basic Swedish clothing and color vocabulary.**

Paper Pelle is an educational game built for students of Swedish for Academics 1 at Uppsala University, taught by Sandra Uitto (Lecturer, Department of Scandinavian Languages). Players read a Swedish description of an outfit and dress Pelle the cat accordingly by selecting clothing from a wardrobe. This game content match the course syllabus.

