## CSS

all `.css` depends on `base.css`, so **`base.css` must be loaded first** in HTML files.
**`css/base.css`**
- Shared components such as buttons and popups.
- Design variables (colors, screen size, shadows, font) in `:root`, so they can be changed in one place.

---

## Tech Stack

- **Frontend:** HTML, CSS, vanilla JavaScript (ES modules)
- **Fonts:** Work Sans (Google Fonts)
- **Version control:** Git, GitHub
- **Dev server:** Python's built-in `http.server`

